  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "31197706",
      "title": "Configuring the Drawer Navigator & The Drawer",
      "lectureOrder": 109,
      "videoOrder": 105,
      "sourceHash": "bdd55dd6275a64cdd2395f0a30251ebd323460ea2190c01775a340e2d1532384",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.29,
          "end": 4.86,
          "en": "Now, just as with the Stack Navigator,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.86,
          "end": 8.89,
          "en": "you can configure your Drawer Navigation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.89,
          "end": 12.81,
          "en": "For example, with the options prop on the drawer screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.81,
          "end": 15.46,
          "en": "and then you can pass an object to options",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.46,
          "end": 17.673,
          "en": "to set all kinds of details here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 18.62,
          "end": 20.52,
          "en": "Just as before, you can, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.52,
          "end": 23.58,
          "en": "set the headerStyle to set a backgroundColor",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24.6,
          "end": 29.6,
          "en": "and set this to actually, maybe let's say, I don't know,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 31.09,
          "end": 36.09,
          "en": "maybe a dark purple color, like the hex code #3c0a6b.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 39.22,
          "end": 41.773,
          "en": "And if I set this, we have to start header.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 43.43,
          "end": 46.683,
          "en": "If we reload, that also is applied to Android.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 47.87,
          "end": 48.78,
          "en": "Now just as before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 48.78,
          "end": 51.24,
          "en": "you then might want to change the text color",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 51.24,
          "end": 54.04,
          "en": "and that's the headerTintColor still",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 54.04,
          "end": 56.392,
          "en": "which you can set to white.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 56.392,
          "end": 59.73,
          "en": "And if you do that, you see the header text is updated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 59.73,
          "end": 62.86,
          "en": "but also the icon color, which is very convenient.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 62.86,
          "end": 65.12,
          "en": "The icon is also added by default",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 65.12,
          "end": 67.99,
          "en": "so, therefore, you can still style all these things",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 67.99,
          "end": 70.52,
          "en": "though certain options will also differ",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 70.52,
          "end": 73.47,
          "en": "between Stack Navigation and Drawer Navigation,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 73.47,
          "end": 74.75,
          "en": "and therefore, as always,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 74.75,
          "end": 77.89,
          "en": "it's the official documentation that you should dive in",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 77.89,
          "end": 80.76,
          "en": "to learn about all the options you can set",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 80.76,
          "end": 81.71000000000001,
          "en": "because of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 81.71000000000001,
          "end": 84.863,
          "en": "there also are plenty drawer specific options.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 86.16,
          "end": 88.99,
          "en": "For example, and I think that's quite interesting,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 88.99,
          "end": 93.99000000000001,
          "en": "you can also set how a screen is represented in that drawer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 94.95,
          "end": 98.7,
          "en": "By default, here we have the title,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 98.7,
          "end": 101.58,
          "en": "and therefore by default, the name of a screen here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 101.58,
          "end": 105.63,
          "en": "in that drawer but you can fine-tune all these things.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 105.63,
          "end": 107.93,
          "en": "For example, with drawerLabel,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 107.93,
          "end": 110.713,
          "en": "you can also add a icon with drawerIcon,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 110.713,
          "end": 112.25999999999999,
          "en": "and you can change the colors",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 112.25999999999999,
          "end": 114.723,
          "en": "that are applied in that drawer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 118.66,
          "end": 122.84,
          "en": "So to play around with that, we could, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 122.84,
          "end": 127.84,
          "en": "say that for this screen, if it is represented in a drawer,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 128.15,
          "end": 132.447,
          "en": "we want to set the label to 'Welcome Screen'",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 133.4,
          "end": 134.883,
          "en": "instead of just welcome.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 136.11,
          "end": 137.94,
          "en": "And if we do this and save this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 137.94,
          "end": 140.573,
          "en": "we have 'Welcome Screen' here in the drawer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 141.42000000000002,
          "end": 143.77,
          "en": "We can also play around with the colors.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 143.77,
          "end": 148.31,
          "en": "And for example, we can set the drawerActiveBackgroundColor",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 148.31,
          "end": 151.15,
          "en": "and choose this purple color as a base,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 151.15,
          "end": 154.857,
          "en": "and then go to a lighter version like #f0e1ff",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 157.68,
          "end": 161.07999999999998,
          "en": "and now this light purple is used as a background.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 161.07999999999998,
          "end": 164.7,
          "en": "We can also change the active tint color of the text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 164.7,
          "end": 168.44,
          "en": "by setting the drawerActiveTintColor here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 168.44,
          "end": 170.49,
          "en": "and setting this to our purple,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 170.49,
          "end": 175.49,
          "en": "to our dark purple color here so that now we have this look.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 179.18,
          "end": 182.05,
          "en": "We can also target the overall drawerStyle",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 183.23,
          "end": 185.93,
          "en": "and then assign an object to this to, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 185.93,
          "end": 188.75,
          "en": "set the background color of the overall drawer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 188.75,
          "end": 192.853,
          "en": "to this light gray with the hex code #ccc.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 193.94,
          "end": 196.26,
          "en": "With this, we have this gray background here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 196.26,
          "end": 198.3,
          "en": "If you want that or not is a different question,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 198.3,
          "end": 200.343,
          "en": "but you can set all these things.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 201.53,
          "end": 204.4,
          "en": "Now, please note that if I switch to the user screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 204.4,
          "end": 207.61,
          "en": "that background color is gone, and the background color",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 207.61,
          "end": 210.13,
          "en": "of the selected item also changed again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 210.13,
          "end": 212.66,
          "en": "because I set all these options",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 212.66,
          "end": 215.203,
          "en": "on the WelcomeScreen configuration.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 216.25,
          "end": 219.32999999999998,
          "en": "You can do that, but just as before with the stack screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 219.32999999999998,
          "end": 222.14,
          "en": "that means that these options only apply",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 222.14,
          "end": 223.74,
          "en": "to this WelcomeScreen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 224.66,
          "end": 226.55,
          "en": "If you have general options",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 226.55,
          "end": 228.68,
          "en": "like the drawerActiveBackgroundColor",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 228.68,
          "end": 230.85,
          "en": "and the drawerStyle and so on,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 230.85,
          "end": 234.01,
          "en": "you therefore typically want to extract them from here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 235.94,
          "end": 238.98,
          "en": "and instead, add them here on the Drawer.Navigator",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 238.98,
          "end": 240.35,
          "en": "to screenOptions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 240.35,
          "end": 242.1,
          "en": "And now I'm getting some auto-completion here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 242.1,
          "end": 243.173,
          "en": "which is convenient.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 244.31,
          "end": 245.77,
          "en": "I also will extract the headerStyle",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 245.77,
          "end": 248.743,
          "en": "and headerTintColor like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 249.87,
          "end": 251.73,
          "en": "And with that, we now set these options",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 251.73,
          "end": 253.55,
          "en": "as a default for all screens",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 253.55,
          "end": 255.35,
          "en": "and it's now just a drawerLabel,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 255.35,
          "end": 257.69,
          "en": "which is screen-specific as it should be",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 257.69,
          "end": 259.94,
          "en": "because that's the label of this screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 259.94,
          "end": 261.943,
          "en": "if represented in the drawer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 263.08,
          "end": 265.05,
          "en": "But now the drawer has the same look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 265.05,
          "end": 267.45,
          "en": "no matter on which screen we are.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 267.45,
          "end": 270.55,
          "en": "And I'm not a fan of that gray background here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 270.55,
          "end": 273.63,
          "en": "so we'll actually get rid of that or commented out",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 273.63,
          "end": 277.423,
          "en": "but it is worth knowing that you can style all these things.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 278.6,
          "end": 280.87,
          "en": "You can also add icons if you want to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 280.87,
          "end": 284.62,
          "en": "and that's another interesting thing, but just as the label,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 284.62,
          "end": 287.37,
          "en": "the icon typically should be screen-specific",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 287.37,
          "end": 290.22,
          "en": "because the different screens should have different icons",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 290.22,
          "end": 292.99,
          "en": "when represented in the drawer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 292.99,
          "end": 295.23,
          "en": "Now you can set the drawerIcon here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 295.23,
          "end": 297.18,
          "en": "and this one's a function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 297.18,
          "end": 299.67,
          "en": "actually, a react component function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 299.67,
          "end": 303.51,
          "en": "where you get some default props, like for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 303.51,
          "end": 305.93,
          "en": "the color which is influenced",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 305.93,
          "end": 308.53,
          "en": "by the ActiveTintColor you set here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 308.53,
          "end": 311.98,
          "en": "So the color chosen by the Drawer.Navigator",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 311.98,
          "end": 314.06,
          "en": "because the color, of course, is different",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 314.06,
          "end": 317.14300000000003,
          "en": "based on whether that item is currently selected or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 318.09,
          "end": 320.39300000000003,
          "en": "And then, you can return your icon here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 321.29,
          "end": 324.173,
          "en": "For example, we can use the good old Ionicons,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 325.66,
          "end": 330.66,
          "en": "Ionicons from '@expo/vector-icons' as we did it before",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 331.92,
          "end": 336.3,
          "en": "so these Ionicons here, and we can then render such a item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 336.3,
          "end": 341.053,
          "en": "And for the WelcomeScreen, we can, therefore, render a icon,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 342.4,
          "end": 345.96,
          "en": "let's say the home icon and set the color to that color",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 345.96,
          "end": 348.86,
          "en": "which is given to us from the navigator.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 348.86,
          "end": 352.57,
          "en": "Because again, that is different based on whether this item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 352.57,
          "end": 355.023,
          "en": "is currently selected in the drawer or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 355.95,
          "end": 359.23,
          "en": "And maybe a size of, let's say, 18,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 359.23,
          "end": 361.23,
          "en": "we can play around with that, of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 362.2,
          "end": 364.32,
          "en": "By the way, besides the color here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 364.32,
          "end": 366.54,
          "en": "we also get a boolean that tells us",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 366.54,
          "end": 368.76,
          "en": "whether this item is currently selected",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 368.76,
          "end": 372.3,
          "en": "in the drawer or not, and we actually also get a size",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 372.3,
          "end": 373.823,
          "en": "so I will use that instead.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 375.28,
          "end": 378.02,
          "en": "And with that, we now have this home icon here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 378.02,
          "end": 381.14,
          "en": "And if I select this, the color of the icon changes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 381.14,
          "end": 386.14,
          "en": "as you can tell and it's also nicely positioned by default",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 386.19,
          "end": 389.18,
          "en": "so we don't have to play around with positioning that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 389.18,
          "end": 391.16,
          "en": "or do any tricky things.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 391.16,
          "end": 394.373,
          "en": "Instead, that is all handled by React Navigation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 395.24,
          "end": 398.06,
          "en": "And of course, we now might wanna add some options",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 398.06,
          "end": 399.82,
          "en": "to the second screen as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 399.82,
          "end": 402.14,
          "en": "And I'm happy with the label there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 402.14,
          "end": 406.35,
          "en": "but here, we can also add our icon just as before",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 406.35,
          "end": 409.56,
          "en": "where we then use destructuring to pull out the color",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 409.56,
          "end": 413.92,
          "en": "and size props, which are provided by React Navigation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 413.92,
          "end": 416.12,
          "en": "to then display another Ionicon.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 416.12,
          "end": 419.28,
          "en": "And here, let's say we have the person icon",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 423.17,
          "end": 426.61,
          "en": "with a color of color and a size of size",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 426.61,
          "end": 430.4,
          "en": "to use the values provided by the Drawer.Navigator.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
